OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after woman dies following
OL,4,Asuspected burglary
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,F75-year-old woman, described by her
OL,8,Ffamily as "truly wonderful", died after
OL,9,Fa suspected burglary in north London.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to reports of a
OL,12,Fburglary in Tollington Park, Finsbury
OL,13,FPark, at 21:20 BST on 11 August, where
OL,14,FRose Smith was found injured. She was
OL,15,Ftaken to hospital but died the
OL,16,Ffollowing day.
OL,18,FAn 81-year-old man was also taken to
OL,19,Fhospital and was discharged the next
OL,20,Fday.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
